4. Entity — UserInfoDao
Create UserInfoDao in package com.securevault.model with:
• @Entity
• A class-level @Table annotation that:
o Explicitly names the table APP_USER (not user)
o Declares a named unique constraint on the username column (name it uk_app_user_username)
• Lombok annotations for getters, setters, no-args constructor, all-args constructor, and builder
• Fields:
o id: Long — primary key, auto-generated using IDENTITY strategy
o username: String — must be non-null, max length 20
o password: String — must be non-null — stores the BCrypt hash, not the plain-text password
o fullName: String — must be non-null, max length 100
o age: short — must be non-null
